WEBVTT

00:02.461 --> 00:04.801
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.901 --> 00:07.961
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.441 --> 00:11.171
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.171 --> 00:15.841
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.241 --> 00:23.241
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.951 --> 00:27.821
Dragon Drive

00:27.821 --> 00:33.351
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.461 --> 00:36.431
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.431 --> 00:39.701
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.171 --> 00:44.541
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.541 --> 00:46.511
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.511 --> 00:52.841
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.551 --> 00:56.921
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.921 --> 01:00.151
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.451 --> 01:05.461
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.461 --> 01:07.051
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.161 --> 01:09.561
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.561 --> 01:12.731
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.101 --> 01:18.171
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.171 --> 01:20.911
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.911 --> 01:28.611
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.891 --> 01:42.191
Put an end to him!

01:45.771 --> 01:47.501
I won't be defeated by these attacks.

01:47.501 --> 01:48.971
I'll fight you!

01:48.971 --> 01:50.631
Lai-Lai Cocoon!

01:59.711 --> 02:02.341
H-How shocking!

02:04.021 --> 02:05.091
Reiji.

02:05.091 --> 02:07.451
I'm looking forward to my match against you.

02:09.691 --> 02:11.951
I won't lose, no matter what!

02:13.991 --> 02:17.051
Mission

02:30.681 --> 02:33.881
That bastard has the nerve
to casually yawn like he's done nothing!

02:33.881 --> 02:34.951
I won't forgive him!

02:34.951 --> 02:38.191
- What's wrong, Maiko?!
- Quiet! Will you just shut up?!

02:38.191 --> 02:39.451
What's the problem?

02:39.451 --> 02:41.441
She could at least tell me why she's upset.

02:41.621 --> 02:43.821
Well, you see, Daisuke...

02:44.961 --> 02:47.491
...the people in the residential quarters
where she lived...

02:47.491 --> 02:49.661
...were eliminated by Guan-Coo.

02:51.601 --> 02:53.871
I just can't take it...

02:53.871 --> 02:57.631
...seeing him lying back so casually,
after doing such cruel things!

02:59.671 --> 03:02.941
How dare he sadden my sweet honey,
Maiko Yukino?!

03:03.411 --> 03:04.971
I will not forgive him!

03:05.051 --> 03:06.051
Hey.

03:06.051 --> 03:07.571
What are you getting all pumped up about?

03:07.711 --> 03:10.481
Guan-Coo's evil deeds are nothing new.

03:10.751 --> 03:14.411
Countless towns have been destroyed by him.

03:14.621 --> 03:17.451
Does that mean people
are suffering even now?

03:17.791 --> 03:18.781
Well, sure.

03:19.161 --> 03:21.821
They say Guan-Coo captures some people
and takes them with him.

03:21.961 --> 03:23.001
Which means...

03:23.001 --> 03:26.691
...there could be people locked up
in Guan-Coo's residence.

03:26.971 --> 03:28.301
Isn't there any way to save them?

03:28.941 --> 03:31.711
Yeah, that's why you're so great,
my sweet honey!

03:31.711 --> 03:33.241
I'll do what I can to help!

03:33.241 --> 03:35.501
Let's go to Guan-Coo's residence!

03:35.741 --> 03:38.881
Stop getting yourselves involved
in matters that don't concern us.

03:38.881 --> 03:39.941
Have you forgotten?

03:40.251 --> 03:43.111
You came here to fulfill a mission, right?

03:43.251 --> 03:44.621
Look at that!

03:48.121 --> 03:49.421
Incredible.

03:49.421 --> 03:50.661
Naturally.

03:50.661 --> 03:52.181
They're fighting for their lives.

03:52.661 --> 03:55.401
I wonder if they're all after the Dragonite.

03:55.401 --> 03:56.261
Not likely.

03:56.261 --> 03:57.091
Huh?

03:58.031 --> 04:00.331
Most who participate
in the Dragonic Heaven...

04:00.331 --> 04:03.301
...don't know the true value
of the Dragonite.

04:03.701 --> 04:06.761
Then why do they fight so desperately?

04:06.941 --> 04:10.171
They want a token of some sort
to tell others, "I'm the best!"

04:10.581 --> 04:12.181
Rikyu is full of people...

04:12.181 --> 04:16.341
...who truly believe that if they're strong,
they can get anything they want!

04:16.621 --> 04:17.551
But more importantly, Reiji...

04:18.251 --> 04:19.581
...I hope you understand.

04:22.221 --> 04:24.591
RI-ON hopes to acquire that Dragonite...

04:24.591 --> 04:26.861
...and aims to resurrect Shinryu.

04:27.761 --> 04:30.961
RI-ON seeks to use Shinryu's power
to achieve their goal...

04:30.961 --> 04:33.991
...of dominating the two worlds,
both the Earth and Rikyu.

04:36.241 --> 04:39.871
I won't let RI-ON, or anyone else,
take the Dragonite!

04:40.241 --> 04:41.211
That's right!

04:41.211 --> 04:42.141
Don't forget!

04:42.141 --> 04:44.511
We cannot lose, at any cost!

04:44.951 --> 04:47.641
And we cannot afford
to be sticking our heads into other matters!

04:49.281 --> 04:50.111
Maiko.

04:50.321 --> 04:52.081
Who's our next opponent?

04:52.491 --> 04:55.421
It says here that we next face
the representatives from Gizaya.

04:55.861 --> 04:57.021
Huh?

04:57.021 --> 04:59.081
That's gotta be a mistake.

04:59.391 --> 05:02.861
I heard that Gizaya's been destroyed
and wiped off the map.

05:02.861 --> 05:05.961
But it says so right here.

05:06.301 --> 05:10.071
I hope we won't have to fight against ghosts.

05:10.501 --> 05:12.731
Representatives from a destroyed village.

05:13.071 --> 05:14.561
I wonder what sorta people we're facing.

05:39.331 --> 05:40.361
Stop it!

05:41.071 --> 05:42.101
Stop it!

05:42.101 --> 05:43.571
Let go of my mother!

05:47.571 --> 05:49.541
If you want your mother back...

05:49.541 --> 05:53.481
...you must win the Dragonic Heaven,
and get the Dragonite!

05:53.481 --> 05:55.471
So says Mr. Guan-Coo.

05:55.651 --> 05:56.581
I refuse.

05:56.581 --> 05:59.551
There's no way I'm going
to fight for your sake!

05:59.551 --> 06:00.851
You sure?

06:02.421 --> 06:03.761
Mother!

06:03.761 --> 06:06.091
If you get the Dragonite...

06:06.091 --> 06:09.161
...all of your wishes will come true,
including the revival of the Gizaya Clan...

06:09.161 --> 06:11.461
...and the recovery of your village.

06:13.031 --> 06:14.531
You mustn't, Mukai!

06:14.531 --> 06:17.371
You mustn't do anything
to help these scoundrels!

06:19.171 --> 06:20.661
Have you made your decision?

06:21.381 --> 06:22.311
Very well.

06:22.311 --> 06:24.611
All right. I'll get the Dragonite.

06:25.851 --> 06:27.041
Mukai!

06:27.151 --> 06:28.211
Mother.

06:28.681 --> 06:31.171
I shall return with the Dragonite for sure.

06:31.421 --> 06:33.051
Please wait until then.

06:33.951 --> 06:34.891
Guan-Coo!

06:34.891 --> 06:36.621
Just make sure you keep your promise!

06:43.461 --> 06:46.261
I will be the one to get the Dragonite.

06:53.271 --> 06:57.281
We can finally fight against
an opponent using our real powers.

06:57.281 --> 06:58.301
Right, Airblast?

07:00.181 --> 07:01.651
I'm also looking forward to it.

07:02.321 --> 07:03.651
Our match is tomorrow.

07:03.921 --> 07:05.681
I wouldn't go out if I were you.

07:06.751 --> 07:10.781
I thought I'd go collect information,
for the good of our team.

07:11.091 --> 07:12.891
Since I am a member of this team.

07:13.031 --> 07:14.081
Oh, really?

07:14.591 --> 07:18.621
You can ask all you want, but I doubt
the priests will tell you where the shrine is.

07:20.371 --> 07:23.471
I'm not interested in fighting.

07:23.471 --> 07:25.371
I'm not uncivilized like you two.

07:26.141 --> 07:27.271
I'm disappointed.

07:27.611 --> 07:29.601
I was counting on your fighting abilities.

07:30.141 --> 07:32.581
I'll do my best, of course.

07:33.011 --> 07:35.111
However, I'll do it in my own way.

07:46.561 --> 07:47.461
What's that, sir?

07:47.461 --> 07:49.501
You find this match uninteresting?

07:49.501 --> 07:50.961
You're bored, sir?

07:51.831 --> 07:52.921
Mr. Guan-Coo!

07:56.641 --> 07:58.631
I just can't forgive that bastard!

08:00.011 --> 08:01.011
Hey! Maiko!

08:01.011 --> 08:02.111
You guys!

08:02.111 --> 08:03.611
Don't make me repeat myself.

08:03.611 --> 08:05.081
You're starting to piss me off.

08:05.311 --> 08:08.371
I hear you, but we can't sit back
and do nothing.

08:14.651 --> 08:15.891
I'm going over to see.

08:15.891 --> 08:17.691
I'll be back before evening.

08:18.361 --> 08:19.851
H-Hey guys!

08:20.831 --> 08:22.031
Damn.

08:22.031 --> 08:24.001
Do they really understand?

08:24.661 --> 08:28.001
Although I must say, this is just like him.

08:38.141 --> 08:40.141
So this is his residence.

08:47.991 --> 08:49.481
Wh-What's this?

08:49.721 --> 08:51.891
These are Rin-Rin's powers.

08:51.891 --> 08:55.001
She's able to convey the thoughts
of those who have passed away.

08:55.001 --> 08:56.761
P-People who have passed away?!

08:56.761 --> 08:59.491
You mean, these people are ghosts?!

08:59.701 --> 09:01.361
They all seem to be suffering a lot.

09:01.771 --> 09:05.261
Give this... to...

09:06.241 --> 09:07.711
Sh-She disappeared!

09:07.971 --> 09:10.471
But the other people are still there!
Why just her?!

09:11.041 --> 09:14.341
I'll bet it's because that person's still alive.
We'd better go and save her!

09:14.551 --> 09:15.981
Y-You sure about that?

09:15.981 --> 09:17.971
Believe in my intuition!

09:18.081 --> 09:21.451
Before that, we'll have to deal
with our own troubles.

09:25.631 --> 09:28.091
We should probably come back
some other time.

09:28.091 --> 09:29.101
Y-Yeah.

09:29.101 --> 09:30.961
But what about that person?

09:30.961 --> 09:32.301
We can't just leave her!

09:32.301 --> 09:34.131
At least for now...

09:34.131 --> 09:35.691
Let's get outta here!

09:51.721 --> 09:53.691
How long do you plan
to keep thinking about it?!

09:55.861 --> 09:59.121
We can't enter the front entrance
with guards there.

09:59.561 --> 10:03.561
We could try to sneak in elsewhere,
but there might be more guards.

10:03.561 --> 10:05.161
What'll we do, Reiji?

10:07.131 --> 10:08.271
Fine, then!

10:08.271 --> 10:09.291
Forget it!

10:09.801 --> 10:12.001
Gholaoh and I will go alone to save her!

10:12.371 --> 10:13.371
Okay!

10:13.371 --> 10:14.911
Then I'll go with Kanper!

10:14.911 --> 10:16.501
Wait a minute, you guys!

10:16.781 --> 10:18.331
What is it?

10:18.581 --> 10:22.311
It's true that this Guan-Coo guy
is an evil villain.

10:22.651 --> 10:25.951
You don't need to hear much about him
to know how terrible he is.

10:27.851 --> 10:29.921
In public, he acts like a lord.

10:29.921 --> 10:32.461
But behind the scenes,
he gets away with the most evil deeds.

10:32.461 --> 10:34.191
That's cruel. Too cruel.

10:34.591 --> 10:36.531
Then that lady must have been captured, too.

10:37.001 --> 10:38.091
We've gotta save her!

10:38.571 --> 10:40.161
Otherwise, they'll eventually kill her.

10:41.001 --> 10:41.991
Wait, Reiji!

10:42.771 --> 10:43.931
Have you forgotten?

10:44.201 --> 10:47.441
He's the sponsor of this Dragonic Heaven!

10:47.711 --> 10:49.141
So what?!

10:49.141 --> 10:51.441
We should let him do what he wants?!

10:51.851 --> 10:53.471
Should Guan-Coo feel like it...

10:53.881 --> 10:55.781
...he could disqualify us...

10:55.781 --> 10:58.751
...and prevent us from even participating
in the tournament!

10:58.821 --> 11:01.341
Disqualify us from the tournament?

11:01.491 --> 11:02.891
N-No way.

11:02.891 --> 11:04.861
It's one of the benefits of being a sponsor.

11:05.231 --> 11:08.351
The guy's in charge of this Dragonic Heaven.

11:09.431 --> 11:11.661
You could say Guan-Coo himself
is the rulebook.

11:12.301 --> 11:14.801
If we get into any sorta fight with him...

11:14.801 --> 11:17.241
...we may be ousted from the tournament.

11:17.541 --> 11:18.871
Are you okay with that?

11:19.071 --> 11:20.401
B-But...

11:20.911 --> 11:22.981
You don't mind if your little act of justice...

11:22.981 --> 11:26.501
...results in RI-ON walking off
with the Dragonite?

11:28.151 --> 11:30.081
Endure it for now, Reiji!

11:30.551 --> 11:33.281
It won't be too late to do this
after the Dragonic Heaven!

11:33.391 --> 11:34.391
But...

11:34.391 --> 11:36.011
...I can't leave things as they are.

11:43.901 --> 11:44.991
Reiji.

11:45.201 --> 11:48.301
I expected that you wouldn't listen
even if I tried to stop you.

11:48.301 --> 11:49.831
Do you still insist on going?

11:51.541 --> 11:52.531
All right!

11:53.041 --> 11:55.231
Then you'll need to beat me in a fight first!

11:56.211 --> 11:57.341
What's wrong?

11:57.341 --> 11:59.331
Come on, charge at me!

12:03.351 --> 12:04.551
Stop it, you two!

12:04.551 --> 12:06.181
Here I go, Reiji!

12:12.361 --> 12:14.261
Rockaku? Are you all right?

12:15.161 --> 12:16.901
I think he's unconscious.

12:16.901 --> 12:19.371
Now's our chance, Reiji. Let's go!

12:19.371 --> 12:20.591
R-Right.

12:26.471 --> 12:27.711
Oh, boy.

12:27.711 --> 12:29.301
It's not easy looking after those guys.

12:29.611 --> 12:31.701
I know how those three feel...

12:32.081 --> 12:34.681
...but I don't want them getting in my way.

12:34.681 --> 12:35.811
Damn it.

12:36.021 --> 12:38.421
Having teammates is such a drag.

12:55.101 --> 12:56.501
Why'd you come, too?

12:57.041 --> 12:59.101
I don't need you guys with me.

12:59.541 --> 13:02.911
Accompanying one's master
is the job of a subordinate.

13:03.081 --> 13:05.071
Broadly speaking, she's right.

13:06.811 --> 13:09.871
What? You again? What do you want?

13:10.581 --> 13:11.991
I'm here to see Guan-Coo!

13:11.991 --> 13:13.291
Let me through!

13:13.291 --> 13:16.311
It's not Mr. Guan-Coo
you really want to see, is it?

13:18.361 --> 13:21.951
If you want to see your mother,
bring the Dragonite.

13:22.261 --> 13:24.231
Don't you forget what you just said!

13:25.201 --> 13:27.691
Sayaka! Kyoji! We're going back!

13:28.501 --> 13:32.101
I'd hoped I could at least get a glimpse
of my mother before the battle.

13:32.271 --> 13:35.211
There's nothing to worry about, Mr. Mukai.

13:35.341 --> 13:37.781
The Dragonite is ours.

13:48.191 --> 13:52.151
I can't believe Rockaku would faint so easily
after putting up such a fight.

13:52.461 --> 13:55.791
Maybe, despite his big body,
he's not too powerful, after all.

13:57.601 --> 13:58.861
Rockaku.

14:03.441 --> 14:05.801
So, what'll we do now?

14:06.041 --> 14:08.671
Do you know where to find
that captured person?

14:09.041 --> 14:10.441
Do you know, Rin-Rin?

14:14.681 --> 14:15.511
That way!

14:15.821 --> 14:17.311
Let's follow Rin-Rin.

14:17.821 --> 14:20.841
We'd better proceed as quietly as possible,
so as not to cause a stir.

14:21.491 --> 14:22.391
Mm-hm.

14:22.391 --> 14:26.591
Otherwise, Guan-Coo could disqualify us
from the tournament.

14:26.931 --> 14:28.331
You think we'll succeed?

14:28.731 --> 14:30.591
We won't know until we try.

14:30.861 --> 14:31.961
You're right.

14:45.851 --> 14:47.341
This is awful.

15:06.701 --> 15:07.631
There she is!

15:07.631 --> 15:08.661
That's her!

15:11.801 --> 15:13.571
It's no use. It won't open.

15:14.041 --> 15:16.031
I should've brought Kanper with me.

15:16.441 --> 15:17.341
Don't worry.

15:17.341 --> 15:20.611
- Chibi will be able to help.
- You don't often hear of people...

15:20.611 --> 15:22.481
...sneaking in to prison.

15:22.951 --> 15:25.691
You don't realize how big
a mistake you've made...

15:25.691 --> 15:26.981
...by sneaking inside
Mr. Guan-Coo's residence.

15:27.321 --> 15:28.491
They found us!

15:28.491 --> 15:29.621
Unbelievable.

15:29.621 --> 15:31.951
We're unable to save her,
after coming this close?

15:32.091 --> 15:33.081
Damn!

15:33.561 --> 15:34.751
What'll we do, Reiji?

15:35.501 --> 15:36.291
Reiji?

15:36.861 --> 15:38.461
Sorry, Rockaku.

15:39.101 --> 15:41.831
We won't be able to continue
in the tournament.

15:42.771 --> 15:43.671
Chibi!

15:43.841 --> 15:45.461
I'm counting on you!

15:51.281 --> 15:54.111
Mr. Guan-Coo does not forgive
unpardonable people like you...

15:54.411 --> 15:56.881
...who sneak into his residence!

15:56.881 --> 15:58.211
Say your prayers!

16:09.501 --> 16:12.031
Ouch! Are you both okay?

16:12.031 --> 16:13.601
Yes, I'm fine.

16:13.601 --> 16:15.431
Yeah, I guess so.

16:16.001 --> 16:18.001
Where in the world are we?

16:18.001 --> 16:19.911
Let's hurry outta here, Reiji.

16:19.911 --> 16:22.401
It would be nice
if they'd let us escape that easily.

16:22.981 --> 16:23.971
Look at that!

16:30.081 --> 16:32.021
Are those dragon bones?

16:32.021 --> 16:33.821
There's a lot of them.

16:33.951 --> 16:36.361
It's cruel. Just too damn cruel!

16:36.361 --> 16:38.161
Can this be allowed?!

16:38.161 --> 16:40.761
If you have power, does that allow you
to do whatever you want?!

16:40.761 --> 16:42.591
We must stop him from doing these things.

16:43.061 --> 16:44.621
This is just plain wrong!

16:44.961 --> 16:46.691
In any case, let's look for the exit.

16:46.871 --> 16:49.331
We've gotta get outta here!

16:59.811 --> 17:01.581
Th-The bones are melting.

17:01.581 --> 17:05.071
Is that who's responsible for turning all
who've fallen in here into bones?!

17:05.421 --> 17:06.951
I won't lose.

17:06.951 --> 17:08.821
No matter what!

17:08.891 --> 17:09.881
Chibi!

17:25.571 --> 17:27.471
Chibi's attacks have no effect?!

17:32.811 --> 17:35.151
If he touches that thing, Chibi will melt!

17:35.151 --> 17:37.781
Wh-What are we gonna do?!

17:49.101 --> 17:50.101
Chibi!

17:50.101 --> 17:51.961
Reiji! Get away from it!

17:51.961 --> 17:53.191
It's dangerous!

17:54.871 --> 17:56.141
Wh-What was that?!

17:56.141 --> 17:57.801
Dragons that can liquefy...

17:58.271 --> 18:01.071
...can resist physical attacks
with little problem.

18:02.211 --> 18:04.041
K-Kyoji!

18:04.741 --> 18:05.731
Kyoji.

18:06.211 --> 18:07.471
What are you doing here?

18:07.811 --> 18:09.521
Reiji Ohzora.

18:09.521 --> 18:12.721
I just don't want anyone
getting in the way of our battle.

18:12.721 --> 18:14.151
That's all.

18:20.431 --> 18:21.451
Kyoji!

18:24.761 --> 18:26.401
I've got no choice...

18:26.401 --> 18:29.391
...although I would've preferred not to show
any of my techniques ahead of time.

18:35.841 --> 18:38.331
Get away, Kyoji! It'll melt you!

18:40.351 --> 18:41.441
No need to worry.

18:49.291 --> 18:53.091
As long as the enemy is liquid,
it's no match for Airblast.

18:53.431 --> 18:57.261
Airblast is the best there is
at controlling liquids.

19:05.911 --> 19:07.171
Go ahead, Chibi!

19:21.251 --> 19:21.911
Kyoji?

19:22.161 --> 19:23.521
Reiji Ohzora.

19:23.521 --> 19:25.721
I look forward to tomorrow's match.

19:25.831 --> 19:27.381
Tomorrow's match?

19:28.791 --> 19:30.351
You'll find out tomorrow.

19:41.041 --> 19:42.341
Guan-Coo.

19:44.541 --> 19:48.071
I'll be sure to return
to save you, I promise.

20:02.801 --> 20:04.131
I see you're back safely.

20:04.301 --> 20:05.361
Rockaku.

20:06.171 --> 20:08.801
We have just one objective.

20:08.801 --> 20:10.201
To become champions!

20:10.501 --> 20:11.401
That's all.

20:12.511 --> 20:14.531
As long as you understand that, I'm cool.

20:14.941 --> 20:19.741
Sorry, but I couldn't care less
about what you wanna do.

20:32.761 --> 20:36.851
We will now begin the first match
of the second round!

20:40.931 --> 20:42.301
It's not just Kyoji.

20:42.771 --> 20:44.971
Sayaka's also participating
in the tournament.

20:44.971 --> 20:47.741
Wh-What's that girl doing here?!

20:48.171 --> 20:50.611
What's that? Do you guys know them?

20:50.611 --> 20:53.411
Yeah. They're friends we know
from Dragon Drive.

20:53.751 --> 20:54.911
I see.

20:54.911 --> 20:57.751
So they came here
from the same world as Reiji.

20:58.551 --> 21:00.221
Then he'll be coming, too.

21:00.221 --> 21:01.481
I know it!

21:01.921 --> 21:05.251
And I will not be defeated
until I face that bastard in a match!

21:05.521 --> 21:09.481
Reiji. I've been waiting for this moment.

21:09.831 --> 21:13.391
Kyoji. I can't afford to lose to you.

21:20.371 --> 21:22.011
I will not lose!

21:22.011 --> 21:23.771
I cannot afford to lose!

21:24.241 --> 21:26.371
Let's do it! Sayaka! Kyoji!

21:57.141 --> 21:59.881
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.881 --> 22:02.651
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.651 --> 22:06.611
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:08.051 --> 22:10.821
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.821 --> 22:13.021
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.461 --> 22:17.591
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:19.001 --> 22:21.671
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.671 --> 22:24.401
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.401 --> 22:28.401
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.711 --> 22:32.211
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.211 --> 22:35.211
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.211 --> 22:40.121
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.751 --> 22:43.491
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.491 --> 22:46.261
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.261 --> 22:50.921
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.631 --> 22:54.401
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.401 --> 22:57.071
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:57.071 --> 23:01.731
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.381 --> 23:06.901
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.811 --> 23:13.511
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:16.021 --> 23:18.511
Next Episode

23:18.561 --> 23:20.261
What a surprise.

23:20.261 --> 23:23.161
Who would've expected Kyoji Tachibana
and that flirty girl, Sayaka Towa...

23:23.161 --> 23:24.691
...to be here in Rikyu?

23:25.431 --> 23:27.901
And as if that's not enough,
we're fighting against them right away?!

23:28.301 --> 23:32.101
That's right! That Mukai guy also shows up,
making this a totally confused battle!

23:32.101 --> 23:35.801
I don't know what his deal is, but he's
coming at me with a scary look on his face!

23:36.881 --> 23:40.051
Next time on Dragon Drive,
"Winner and Loser".

23:40.051 --> 23:42.951
I don't know what reasons he has for fighting,
but I cannot afford to lose!

23:42.951 --> 23:45.521
Winner and Loser
I don't know what reasons he has for fighting,
but I cannot afford to lose!
